{
  "info": {
    "name": "Dapr AI Loan Workflow - Complete API Collection",
    "description": "Comprehensive API collection for Home Loan AI Agent Service.\n\n## Architecture\n- Spring Boot 3.5 + Spring AI + Groq LLM (llama-3.3-70b)\n- Dapr for service invocation, workflows, and state management\n- 6 AI Tools: PAN, Aadhaar, Credit, Income, Fraud, Property\n- ReAct Pattern for autonomous decision making\n\n## Endpoints Overview\n1. **Agentic Processing** - LLM autonomously decides tools and makes decisions\n2. **Dapr Workflow** - Orchestrated multi-agent workflow\n3. **LLM Testing** - Direct LLM interaction\n4. **Health & Diagnostics** - Service health checks\n\n## How to Run\n```bash\n# Start mock services\ncd banking-mock-services && dapr run -f dapr.yaml\n\n# Start agent service\ndapr run --app-id loan-agent-service --app-port 8081 --dapr-http-port 3500 --resources-path ./dapr/components -- .\\gradlew.bat bootRun\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "description": "Direct application URL"},
    {"key": "daprUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3500", "description": "Dapr sidecar URL"},
    {"key": "appId", "value": "loan-agent-service", "description": "Dapr App ID"},
    {"key": "instanceId", "value": "", "description": "Workflow instance ID (auto-populated)"}
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🤖 1. Agentic Loan Processing (Direct API)",
      "description": "Direct API calls to the Autonomous Loan Agent.\nThe LLM autonomously decides which tools to call and makes the final decision.\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /api/loan/apply/agentic\n**Alternative:** POST /api/autonomous/process",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Excellent Applicant - Should APPROVE",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Rahul Sharma\",\n  \"panNumber\": \"BSRPS1234K\",\n  \"aadhaarNumber\": \"499118665246\",\n  \"annualIncome\": 2400000,\n  \"requestedLoanAmount\": 5000000,\n  \"loanTenureYears\": 20,\n  \"creditScore\": 780,\n  \"existingEmi\": 10000,\n  \"employmentType\": \"SALARIED\",\n  \"employerName\": \"Tata Consultancy Services\",\n  \"yearsOfExperience\": 8,\n  \"propertyType\": \"APARTMENT\",\n  \"propertyValue\": 8000000,\n  \"propertyLocation\": \"Mumbai\"\n}"},
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loan/apply/agentic",
            "description": "**EXPECTED: APPROVED**\n\n✅ Valid Aadhaar (499118665246 passes Verhoeff checksum)\n✅ Credit Score: 780 (Excellent)\n✅ Income: ₹24 LPA\n✅ LTV: 62.5% (Good)\n✅ DTI: Low\n✅ Employment: 8 years at TCS"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Poor Credit Applicant - Should REJECT",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Vikram Singh\",\n  \"panNumber\": \"AVSPS5678M\",\n  \"aadhaarNumber\": \"567890123458\",\n  \"annualIncome\": 600000,\n  \"requestedLoanAmount\": 5000000,\n  \"loanTenureYears\": 20,\n  \"creditScore\": 520,\n  \"existingEmi\": 25000,\n  \"employmentType\": \"SELF_EMPLOYED\",\n  \"employerName\": \"Self\",\n  \"yearsOfExperience\": 2,\n  \"propertyType\": \"PLOT\",\n  \"propertyValue\": 4500000,\n  \"propertyLocation\": \"Tier3City\"\n}"},
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loan/apply/agentic",
            "description": "**EXPECTED: REJECTED**\n\n❌ Invalid Aadhaar (567890123458 fails Verhoeff checksum)\n❌ Credit Score: 520 (Poor)\n❌ Income: ₹6 LPA (Low for ₹50L loan)\n❌ High DTI with existing EMI ₹25K\n❌ Self-employed with only 2 years experience"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Invalid Aadhaar - Should REJECT",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Amit Kumar\",\n  \"panNumber\": \"ABCDE1234F\",\n  \"aadhaarNumber\": \"234567890123\",\n  \"annualIncome\": 1500000,\n  \"requestedLoanAmount\": 5000000,\n  \"loanTenureYears\": 20,\n  \"creditScore\": 750,\n  \"employmentType\": \"SALARIED\",\n  \"employerName\": \"Infosys\",\n  \"yearsOfExperience\": 10,\n  \"propertyType\": \"APARTMENT\",\n  \"propertyValue\": 7500000,\n  \"propertyLocation\": \"Mumbai\"\n}"},
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loan/apply/agentic",
            "description": "**EXPECTED: REJECTED**\n\n❌ Invalid Aadhaar (234567890123 fails Verhoeff checksum)\n✅ Other factors are good but invalid Aadhaar is a deal-breaker"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Borderline Case - May MANUAL_REVIEW",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Priya Patel\",\n  \"panNumber\": \"BXYPK5678M\",\n  \"aadhaarNumber\": \"499118665246\",\n  \"annualIncome\": 1800000,\n  \"requestedLoanAmount\": 7500000,\n  \"loanTenureYears\": 25,\n  \"creditScore\": 680,\n  \"existingEmi\": 20000,\n  \"employmentType\": \"SALARIED\",\n  \"employerName\": \"Wipro\",\n  \"yearsOfExperience\": 5,\n  \"propertyType\": \"APARTMENT\",\n  \"propertyValue\": 10000000,\n  \"propertyLocation\": \"Pune\"\n}"},
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loan/apply/agentic",
            "description": "**EXPECTED: MANUAL_REVIEW or CONDITIONAL_APPROVAL**\n\n✅ Valid Aadhaar\n⚠️ Credit Score: 680 (Fair - borderline)\n⚠️ High loan amount relative to income\n⚠️ Existing EMI ₹20K\n✅ 5 years experience"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 High Net Worth - Should APPROVE",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Sunita Reddy\",\n  \"panNumber\": \"CXYPR9876L\",\n  \"aadhaarNumber\": \"499118665246\",\n  \"annualIncome\": 5000000,\n  \"requestedLoanAmount\": 10000000,\n  \"loanTenureYears\": 15,\n  \"creditScore\": 820,\n  \"existingEmi\": 0,\n  \"employmentType\": \"SALARIED\",\n  \"employerName\": \"Google India\",\n  \"yearsOfExperience\": 12,\n  \"propertyType\": \"VILLA\",\n  \"propertyValue\": 20000000,\n  \"propertyLocation\": \"Bangalore\"\n}"},
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/loan/apply/agentic",
            "description": "**EXPECTED: APPROVED**\n\n✅ Valid Aadhaar\n✅ Credit Score: 820 (Exceptional)\n✅ Income: ₹50 LPA\n✅ LTV: 50% (Excellent)\n✅ No existing EMI\n✅ 12 years at Google"
          }
        },
